– U.S. Praised ...\",\"description\":\"Oct 4, 2023 · Thirty years ago in Moscow, Russian President Boris Yeltsin ordered tanks and airborne troops to shell and storm the “White House,” the Russian Parliament ( ...\",\"url\":\"https://nsarchive.gwu.edu/briefing-book/russia-programs/2023-10-04/yeltsin-shelled-russian-parliament-30-years-ago-us-praised\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"95\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Russia's Chechen Wars 1994-2000: Lessons from Urban Combat\",\"description\":\"This report provides an analysis of Russian combat in Chechnya beginning with the first modern Chechen war of 1994–1996 and comparing and contrasting it with ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.rand.org/content/dam/rand/pubs/monograph_reports/MR1289/RAND_MR1289.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"96\",\"title\":\"Russia Rebounds - International Monetary Fund (IMF)\",\"description\":\"The seeds of the 1998 Russian financial crisis lie in the choice, in the mid-1990s, of a set of policy tools designed to achieve macroeconomic stability, but ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.imf.org/external/pubs/nft/2003/russia/index.htm\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"97\",\"title\":\"Long Read: 20 Years of Russia's Economy Under Putin, in Numbers\",\"description\":\"Aug 19, 2019 · Putin was responsible for the first systematic attempt to reform Russia's economy. In 2000 he launched the so-called Gref plan (“Programme for ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2019/08/19/long-read-russias-economy-under-putin-in-numbers-a66924\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"98\",\"title\":\"[PDF] economic roller coaster: 2000–17 - Brookings Institution\",\"description\":\"Many attribute Russia's economic achievements during the period of 1999–2008 to Vladimir Putin and his economic policies, with the “lost decade” that followed ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.brookings.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/9780815732761_ch1.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"99\",\"title\":\"Putin's Failures to Deliver | FSI\",\"description\":\"Aug 2, 2023 · The sur