2022 ...\",\"url\":\"https://citizenx.com/insights/russia-wealth-exodus/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"382\",\"title\":\"Russian Factories Hired Nearly 50K Foreign Workers in 2024\",\"description\":\"Jun 23, 2025 · Labor shortages in the construction, manufacturing and technology sectors are linked to the war in Ukraine and import substitution policies ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2025/06/23/russian-factories-hired-nearly-50k-foreign-workers-in-2024-labor-ministry-a89537\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"383\",\"title\":\"Russia demographics 2025 - StatisticsTimes.com\",\"description\":\"Feb 4, 2025 · As of 2025, the population of Russia is projected at 144.00 million, compared to 144.82 million in 2024. It is the most populous country in Europe.\",\"url\":\"https://statisticstimes.com/demographics/country/russia-demographics.php\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"384\",\"title\":\"Total Fertility Rate of Russian Federation - Population - database.earth\",\"description\":\"The current population fertility rate of Russian Federation is 1.4647 births per woman. A 0.53% increase from 2024, when the fertility rate only was 1.457 ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://database.earth/population/russian-federation/fertility-rate\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"385\",\"title\":\"Russia Population (2025) - Worldometer\",\"description\":\"World Population Prospects: The 2024 Revision. (Medium-fertility variant). Russia Demographics. Main Page: Demographics of Russia. Life Expectancy. 73.5 years.\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/russia-population/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"386\",\"title\":\"Need and loathing in Russia: unpacking the labor migration paradox\",\"description\":\"Sep 9, 2025 · Central Asian labor migrants have been hit the hardest by the changes, given that they make up roughly 10.5 million of Russia's estimated 12-14 ...\",\"url\":\"https://eurasianet.org/commentary-need-and-loathing-in-russia-unpacking-the-labor-migra