243\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"392\",\"title\":\"Federal State Statistics Service\",\"description\":\"Population (01.01.2025) resident population estimate · 146 119,9 · thousand people ; GDP at current prices 2025 (first estimate) · 49 516,8 · bln. roubles ; GDP ...Official Statistics · Population Census · Population and Census Data · About\",\"url\":\"https://eng.rosstat.gov.ru/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"393\",\"title\":\"Russia's Current Demographic Crisis Is Its Most Dangerous Yet\",\"description\":\"Sep 26, 2025 · Worse still, this was largely a brain drain, as those who left were predominantly young, highly qualified professionals. Since then, the ...\",\"url\":\"https://carnegieendowment.org/russia-eurasia/politika/2025/09/russia-new-demographic-crisis?lang=en\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"394\",\"title\":\"Russia's Demographic Vanishing Act: A Warning From History\",\"description\":\"Aug 6, 2025 · Russia's population is already in decline, peaking at 149 million in 1994, to about 145 million today, and is likely to decline even more this ...Missing:  size | Show results with:size\",\"url\":\"https://www.russiamatters.org/analysis/russias-demographic-vanishing-act-warning-history\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"395\",\"title\":\"How The War In Ukraine Has Sparked A Demographic Crisis In Russia\",\"description\":\"Oct 8, 2025 · Russia's war in Ukraine has sparked a demographic crisis and labor shortage, fueled by military casualties, emigration, and a shrinking ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/marktemnycky/2025/10/08/how-the-war-in-ukraine-has-sparked-a-demographic-crisis-in-russia/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"396\",\"title\":\"Tragedy After Disaster? War in Ukraine and Demography\",\"description\":\"Feb 24, 2025 · With an average age of 35 for combatants, Russian losses will weigh heavily on the country's demographic, societal and economic future.\",\"url\":\"https://www.institutmontaigne.org/en/expressions/tragedy-after-catastrophe-demograp