/countries/rus/russia/fertility-rate\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"458\",\"title\":\"Russia's Birth Rate Plunges to 200-Year Low - The Moscow Times\",\"description\":\"Apr 14, 2025 · Russia recorded 1.222 million births in 2024, the lowest annual total since 1999. Compared to 2014, the birth rate has fallen by a third.\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2025/04/14/russias-birth-rate-plunges-to-200-year-low-a88709\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"459\",\"title\":\"Russia's Demographic Crisis - Wilson Center\",\"description\":\"Russia has experienced a drop in overall population due to a conjuncture of birth decline and mortality increase.\u003c|control11|\u003e\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.wilsoncenter.org/publication/russias-demographic-crisis\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"460\",\"title\":\"Assessing the impact of the maternity capital policy in Russia\",\"description\":\"In 2007, Russian government introduced “maternity capital” policy, which entitled women who gave birth to at least two children to a one-time generous ( ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0927537114000232\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"461\",\"title\":\"Putin's Irrational Demographic Policies Are Doomed to Fail\",\"description\":\"Mar 11, 2025 · Trying to boost Russia's fertility rate at the same time as sending tens of thousands of men off to die in a large-scale war in Ukraine is clearly irrational.\",\"url\":\"https://carnegieendowment.org/russia-eurasia/politika/2025/02/russia-demographic-politics?lang=en\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"462\",\"title\":\"The Kremlin, in Need of Workers, Calls on Pensioners - Russia.Post\",\"description\":\"Nov 11, 2024 · The retirement age hike ultimately reduced the number of pensioners – from 42.7 million in 2020 to 41.0 million in 2024, which is still a ...Missing:  welfare | Show results with:welfare\",\"url\":\"https://russiapost.info/society/kremlin_pensioners\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"463\",\"ti